cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "RISE — Research Information Systems Engineering"
message: "If you reference this knowledge base, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Hanneke
    given-names: Björn
    affiliation: Goethe University Frankfurt
    email: hanneke@wiwi.uni-frankfurt.de
repository-code: "https://github.com/bhanneke/RISE"
url: "https://bhanneke.github.io/RISE/"
abstract: >
  RISE is a public knowledge base introducing Research Information
  Systems Engineering — the design and study of information systems
  that produce scholarly knowledge, with a focus on agentic research
  pipelines. It maintains two curated catalogs: (i) an academic-papers
  database with structured notes, and (ii) a projects database
  evaluating agentic research systems against a standard rubric.
keywords:
  - research-information-systems
  - agentic-research
  - ai-scientist
  - knowledge-base
  - research-infrastructure
